1. Pham vi
Tai lieu gan nhan giao thong 2D cho du an GreenSM.

2. Quy tac chung
Box om sat vat. Vat bi che van dong box toan bo (amodal).

3.1 O to (car)
Moi o to dong box om sat ca banh xe. Xe tai (truck) va xe buyt (bus) gan nhan rieng.

3.2 Xe GreenSM
Taxi mau xanh ngoc cua GreenSM gan nhan GreenSM, khong gan car.

3.3 Xe may (motorcycle)
Xe may va nguoi lai: nguoi lai co box person rieng.

3.4 Nguoi (person)
Nguoi di bo va nguoi lai xe deu gan person.
